{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b89c835dd81fead31271285f49b373df88ab21fabc5104c209488de9ea8254e2", "ja": "（今日は映画『超ビーチバレー』の宣材写真撮影だ。\n各所との調整や打ち合わせが続いているのだが……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄电影《超级沙滩排球》的宣传照。\n我一直在忙着沟通、调整各处的行程……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "6c102c7756688f3243db1b3e2fe700bee659339cdad54dd2cb03eb6b5bb9c500", "ja": "あ、やっぱりここにおった♪\n{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！", "zh": "啊，果然在这♪\n{$P$}先生，你辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1002_p", "source_sha256": "00700fabb23da7b7b8a6f7aee2db48824f67712038c6d5b06c288666ffd796cf", "ja": "奈緒、お疲れさま。何か用事か？", "zh": "奈绪，辛苦了。有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "fa502f9942da283dd2d15c5986fa2c67ba48dd74e456d5803a34a9caeadbf304", "ja": "ちょっと、一息入れません？　私、お茶淹れますし。\nあんまり根つめすぎるんも、よくないですよ！", "zh": "你要不要歇一会？我去泡茶。\n太劳神费心对身体不好喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1005_p", "source_sha256": "77ec787ce89aa75476996015ab2f944dc9c2de996dbed6a33a259b9120391e1c", "ja": "おっ、ありがとう。\nそうだな、少し休憩するか……ふぅ。", "zh": "喔，谢谢你。\n说得也是，那我就休息一下吧……呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "a2fe2427687086c49d1891af0f92e940a022b707a2678ff154425e32a27e55e6", "ja": "なんや、メッチャ疲れてますやん……。\n疲れたときには甘いもんや！　はい、アメちゃん。", "zh": "感觉你整个人都累翻了耶……\n疲劳的时候就要吃甜食啦！来，给你糖果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1007_p", "source_sha256": "850d693abde7a2492e421a9010ee281d37df7f5ddaf5c600a244b21267165b6d", "ja": "ああ、いただきます。\n……うん、疲れた時には甘いものだな。", "zh": "好，我不客气了。\n……嗯，疲劳的时候真的要吃甜食呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "58973a4e7ea07b339db6653d88e3b4b42819bc667406d17112a7f064565cfa85", "ja": "えへへ、よかった♪\n……ん、なあなあ、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了♪\n……嗯，{$P$}先生，我问你喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7c59608752f267d6180b140d18e7d63d6eab88ec8f53b1bf3132cb2afda45b46", "ja": "うん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "d77936df392ad11bc3bda494d384a52f20ea21764cb2a325c7eada6b11b3245e", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、なんで私を悪役に\n選んだんかな～って、ちょっと気になってて……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生为什么\n要选我当反派角色呢～我有点好奇……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "2448ba3be6101f1e7d34af822d6624e3c1cb1ee7204febfc2b21d5a9b49d6a66", "ja": "オーディション受けたんは私やけど、『クイーン』って\n言うたんは、{$P$}さんやったから。", "zh": "接受试镜的人虽然是我，但指定『女王』\n这个角色的人是{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "e03e2bc735ee954c02ae60e5d6ce1c84e542774d63fa494c499d43c18cb0aeba", "ja": "あ、別にイヤやったとか、そういうんじゃないんです！\nただ、ちょっとだけ！　ちょっとだけ気になって！", "zh": "啊，我不是觉得反感之类的喔！\n只是有点好奇！真的只是有点好奇而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1014_p", "source_sha256": "05451a051d595b83a3a1557fad612ae9f5b2bad3b1c076ebdc7b82b0cdc0f79e", "ja": "そうだな……奈緒が、優しいからかな？", "zh": "这个嘛……我想是因为奈绪很善良吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "7931af87d6a37002c466eac4c5f72e047fbe4ac7281d770768c92e0ac7f34cff", "ja": "へ？　……{$P$}さん、\n私の質問聞いてました？", "zh": "咦？……{$P$}先生，\n你有听清楚我刚刚问什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2f64441732233e75bfa20175b3f6082c209ec99c1763f3d5d4f9d683ae86ff8f", "ja": "もちろん聞いてたよ。奈緒は人のために\n動く事ができるから、クイーンに適役だと思ったんだ。", "zh": "当然有呀，奈绪会为了别人付出行动，\n所以我才认为你适合女王这个角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1017_p", "source_sha256": "54b443e746ae0407ca1a07a42c36c8152fa6a30461c919282cd35f94f07676f6", "ja": "クイーンは、キングを勝たせるために一生懸命だった。\n方法は良くなかったみたいだけど……。", "zh": "虽然方法不是很洽当……\n但为了让王者获胜，女王也是费尽心力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1019_p", "source_sha256": "dffe81da9dcfafacdfbbabd5884e12c500e6ef353c89e9b334b62cc4b80d99ae", "ja": "奈緒なら、イヤなだけの悪役にならないと思ったんだ。\nこうしてお茶やアメを持ってきてくれたみたいにな！", "zh": "奈绪肯定不会只演成单纯心狠手辣的反派角色，\n就像现在你泡茶请我吃糖一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "bfc6d1c29a55bdb71a7db08eef6dfb88c1fa12cb38072feb49c543e1b628d8f9", "ja": "え……そんな、ほめんといてくださいよ……♪\nえへ、えへへへへ……♪", "zh": "咦……你别这样夸我啦……♪\n嘿嘿、嘿嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "c33a1373fec2ebcce564243b107e28f14b7de1377e039c9da11d08100f5032de", "ja": "でも、なんやスッキリしました！\nありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "不过，我现在觉得心情舒畅多了！\n谢谢你的回答，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_037nao0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_037nao0093_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "c11c90513b6d953b3f489fa96641befcb5f481dc9b75902b79ec98198ace3313", "ja": "よっしゃ！　悪役、どんとこいですよ！\nまたオーディションあったら教えてくださいね！", "zh": "好呀！反派角色，尽管来吧！\n下次还有试镜机会记得跟我说喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
